    <p>
      These Terms are governed by the laws of the operator's jurisdiction.
      <!-- TODO-OPERATOR: set the governing law and venue for your
      jurisdiction before a production launch. -->
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">12. Contact and operator details</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these Terms can be sent to
      <%= mail_to identity[:legal_email], nil, class: "underline underline-offset-2" %>.
      Support is available at
      <%= mail_to identity[:support_email], nil, class: "underline underline-offset-2" %>.
    </p>
    <p>
      This deployment is a test-only demo. Before a production launch the
